    "reasoning": "For q-7905, direct multiplication gives AB=BA=I₃, so B=A⁻¹. Since E=A, AE=EA=A² has second-row, first-column entry -10 and is not I₃. Thus I and III alone are true. For q-102666, det(A)=3 and A⁻¹=(1/3)[[2,-1],[1,1]]=B. Since C=3B, AC=CA=3I₂ and C≠A⁻¹. Thus only I is true. Both earlier answers agree with the mathematics and their respective captured worked solutions; no submitted grades were provided.",
